    "content": "<style>@media only screen and (max-width:600px) {\n        .ck-mobile-font-size {\n          font-size: 50px !important;\n        }\n     }</style><div><style>\n  .email {\n    background: #ffffff !important;\n  }\n</style><div class=\"ck-section\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:auto;margin-bottom:40px;margin-left:auto\"><center><table cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;margin:0 auto;max-width:640px\"><tbody><tr><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td><td width=\"640\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;background-size:cover;background-position:center;box-sizing:border-box\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><div class=\"ck-inner-section ck-padding-default\" style=\"padding-top:36px;padding-right:36px;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:36px\"><div style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;max-width:640px\"><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center;table-layout:fixed;float:none\" class=\"email-image\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\"><figure style=\"margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:12px;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;display:inline-block;max-width:375px;width:100%\"><div style=\"display:block\"><img src=\"https://embed.filekitcdn.com/e/sQPykcbSSsHRVZVvj5Qcv9/uLb6vb1YF4w4f1rqqaETVi\" width=\"375\" height=\"auto\" style=\"border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;width:375px;height:auto;object-fit:contain\"/></div><figcaption style=\"text-align:center;display:none\">\u200b</figcaption></figure></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Dear {{ subscriber.first_name }}</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">We are thrilled to introduce you to the inaugural edition of The Modern Finance Playbook newsletter, your go-to source for insightful updates, trends, and expert analysis in the world of finance. I&#x27;m Paul Barnhurst, your friendly FP&amp;A guy, and with me is Ron Monteiro, your storytelling guy. We have both spent many years in Finance and now focus on helping individuals around the world maximize their potential. Together, we are excited to embark on this journey of knowledge-sharing and exploration with all of you.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Please be aware that this newsletter will replace any newsletters you have previously been receiving from Paul and Ron. </p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">In each issue, you can expect:<br/>\u200b</p><ul class=\"unordered_list\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;list-style-position:inside\"><li class=\"list_item\"><span><strong>Inspirational Quote</strong>: Kick-start your day with a thought-provoking quote that inspires and motivates.<br/>\u200b<br/>\u200b</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span><strong>Upcoming Events/Announcements: </strong>Stay informed about upcoming finance-related events, workshops, and important announcements.<br/>\u200b</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span><strong>Stay Out of Excel Hell: </strong>New formulas and tips and tricks to help you optimize your Excel skills and avoid common pitfalls.<br/>\u200b</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span><strong>Business Partners Corner: </strong>Spotlight on practical ways to enhance your business partnership skills and increase your influence with your stakeholders.<br/>\u200b</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span><strong>Today&#x27;s Playbook - </strong>A Deep Dive for the Modern Finance Leader: Dive into in-depth analyses, strategies, and best practices tailored for the modern finance leader.<br/>\u200b</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span><strong>The FP&amp;A Guy&#x27;s Tech Tips: </strong>Explore the latest in finance-related technology, software, and tools to enhance your efficiency and productivity.<br/>\u200b</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span><strong>Ron&#x27;s Recommendations: </strong> Ron Monteiro shares his expert recommendations on books, articles, podcasts, and more, enriching your finance knowledge.</span></li></ul><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><ul class=\"unordered_list\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;list-style-position:inside\"><li class=\"list_item\"><span><strong>Finance Funnies: </strong>Unwind and enjoy a dose of finance-related humor to brighten your day.</span></li></ul><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">We encourage you to actively engage with us by sharing your feedback, questions, and topic suggestions. Your input is invaluable as it helps us tailor our content to meet your specific interests and needs.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b<br/> If you believe that you received this email in error or are not interested in receiving this newsletter please unsubscribe.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &#x27;Helvetica Neue&#x27;, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b<br/>We look forward to embarking on this enriching journey with you. Together, let&#x27;s explore the fascinating world of finance and empower ourselves with knowledge that drives informed decisions. This will be a bi-weekly newsletter.<br/>\u200b<br/> Warm regards,<br/>\u200b<br/> Paul Barnhurst<br/> The FP&amp;A Guy<br/>\u200b<br/> Ron Monteiro<br/> The Storytelling guy</p></div></div></td><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td></tr></tbody></table><div><!--[if mso]><br /><br /><![endif]--></div></center><style>\n    @media only screen and (max-width:600px) {\n      .ck-padding-default {\n        padding-right: 18px !important;\n        padding-left: 18px !important;\n      }\n\n      .ck-padding-mobile-friendly {\n        padding-right: 18px !important;\n        padding-left: 18px !important;\n      }\n    }\n  </style></div><div class=\"ck-section\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-right:auto;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:auto\"><center><table cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;margin:0 auto;max-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td contenteditable=